## Resolving it

- `AGENTS.md`, at the repository root, says how to work here. `make ready`
  passes before every commit.
- Fix the cause. Do not skip, disable or loosen a test to make it pass.
- Open a pull request that says `Fixes` and this issue's number, so that
  merging it closes this issue. Otherwise devtool closes it, with a comment,
  on the first run that finds the tests passing.
- devtool files no second issue for this failure while this one is open: it
  finds this one by the comment at the top, and brings it up to date each
  time the failure comes back. Leave that comment as it is.

